{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16478043022403821567,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "IRQ Descriptor and irq_chip",
      "source_hash": 18055811988573444886,
      "context_hash": 8883415891779365606,
      "translation": "IRQ 디스크립터와 irq_chip",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212899Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's abstraction over interrupt hardware",
      "source_hash": 16494863703276629506,
      "context_hash": 3083756864973347849,
      "translation": "인터럽트 하드웨어에 대한 커널의 추상화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The three-layer interrupt abstraction",
      "source_hash": 13158308063625694172,
      "context_hash": 7744441809911709708,
      "translation": "3계층 인터럽트 추상화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Linux interrupt subsystem — the genirq framework introduced in Linux 2.6.16 by Thomas Gleixner and Ingo Molnár [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/184750/) — uses three structures to abstract over wildly different interrupt controllers (APIC, GIC, IOAPIC, MSI, GPIO controllers...):",
      "source_hash": 8199738268093533946,
      "context_hash": 17041437800037880749,
      "translation": "Linux 인터럽트 서브시스템, 즉 Thomas Gleixner와 Ingo Molnár가 Linux 2.6.16에서 도입한 genirq 프레임워크[(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/184750/)는 세 가지 구조체를 사용하여 서로 크게 다른 인터럽트 컨트롤러(APIC, GIC, IOAPIC, MSI, GPIO 컨트롤러 등)를 추상화합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "MSI": "MSI",
        "Thomas": "Thomas",
        "controller": "컨트롤러",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct irq_desc",
      "source_hash": 5894883896813073537,
      "context_hash": 16495888464293371937,
      "translation": "struct irq_desc",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "One `irq_desc` exists for each Linux IRQ number.",
      "source_hash": 17344673692206514460,
      "context_hash": 12238702928792384671,
      "translation": "`irq_desc`는 Linux IRQ 번호마다 하나씩 존재합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It's the central object that ties together the hardware abstraction and the software handlers:",
      "source_hash": 10454268807796650596,
      "context_hash": 15513296449511838724,
      "translation": "이는 하드웨어 추상화와 소프트웨어 핸들러를 하나로 묶는 중심 객체입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Key fields:",
      "source_hash": 7927735245171797670,
      "context_hash": 3969744805007172301,
      "translation": "주요 필드:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212900Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_irq`: the **flow handler** — decides how to run the action chain (edge-triggered, level-triggered, per-CPU, etc.)",
      "source_hash": 2214321539415207371,
      "context_hash": 2546326063636250984,
      "translation": "`handle_irq`: **flow 핸들러** — 액션 체인을 실행하는 방식을 결정합니다(edge-triggered, level-triggered, per-CPU 등).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "handler": "핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:29:48.483514Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`action`: linked list of `irqaction` structs, one per registered handler",
      "source_hash": 6932547235637305898,
      "context_hash": 8610099715151068101,
      "translation": "`action`: 등록된 핸들러마다 하나씩 있는 `irqaction` 구조체의 연결 리스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "structs": "구조체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`depth`: incremented by `disable_irq()`, decremented by `enable_irq()` — only 0 means actually enabled",
      "source_hash": 12060129590574276700,
      "context_hash": 13439801998636380241,
      "translation": "`depth`: `disable_irq()`에 의해 증가하고 `enable_irq()`에 의해 감소합니다 — 0일 때만 실제로 활성화된 상태입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct irqaction",
      "source_hash": 10431640487940815251,
      "context_hash": 12947263817942745090,
      "translation": "struct irqaction",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "One `irqaction` per `request_irq()` call.",
      "source_hash": 2240311824752872531,
      "context_hash": 17786655823986586952,
      "translation": "`request_irq()` 호출마다 `irqaction`이 하나씩 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple drivers can share an IRQ line, each with its own `irqaction`:",
      "source_hash": 8018091409995455803,
      "context_hash": 1515325306252505402,
      "translation": "여러 드라이버가 각자의 `irqaction`을 가지고 하나의 IRQ 라인을 공유할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When a shared IRQ fires, the kernel walks the `irqaction` chain calling each handler in turn.",
      "source_hash": 18303166704335819439,
      "context_hash": 17052114239829089209,
      "translation": "공유 IRQ가 발생하면 커널은 `irqaction` 체인을 순회하면서 각 핸들러를 차례로 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Each handler returns `IRQ_HANDLED` if it handled the interrupt, or `IRQ_NONE` if it wasn't its device.",
      "source_hash": 13338174442681809475,
      "context_hash": 8392552767214435093,
      "translation": "각 핸들러는 인터럽트를 처리했으면 `IRQ_HANDLED`를, 자신의 디바이스에서 발생한 인터럽트가 아니면 `IRQ_NONE`을 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212901Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct irq_chip",
      "source_hash": 9462922088516973562,
      "context_hash": 8185916554589631734,
      "translation": "struct irq_chip",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The `irq_chip` provides operations for controlling the interrupt controller hardware.",
      "source_hash": 10625830425994666208,
      "context_hash": 16395822561381277979,
      "translation": "`irq_chip`은 인터럽트 컨트롤러 하드웨어를 제어하는 연산을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controller": "컨트롤러",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each controller (APIC, ARM GIC, etc.) implements this interface:",
      "source_hash": 10325741701865023440,
      "context_hash": 6746983940767977304,
      "translation": "각 컨트롤러(APIC, ARM GIC 등)는 이 인터페이스를 구현합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Drivers typically don't call `irq_chip` operations directly — the generic IRQ layer calls them at the right time.",
      "source_hash": 7980698956119053138,
      "context_hash": 14145952983019149678,
      "translation": "드라이버는 일반적으로 `irq_chip` 연산을 직접 호출하지 않습니다 — 범용 IRQ 계층이 적절한 시점에 이를 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "IRQ domains",
      "source_hash": 855217420767601150,
      "context_hash": 5632320194759289439,
      "translation": "IRQ 도메인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Modern systems have hierarchical interrupt controllers (e.g., GPIO expander → GIC → CPU). **IRQ domains** map hardware interrupt numbers to Linux IRQ numbers:",
      "source_hash": 14927187911553196767,
      "context_hash": 17713184571404101673,
      "translation": "최신 시스템은 계층적인 인터럽트 컨트롤러(예: GPIO 익스팬더 → GIC → CPU)를 갖추고 있습니다. **IRQ 도메인**은 하드웨어 인터럽트 번호를 Linux IRQ 번호에 매핑합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "controller": "컨트롤러",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212902Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Flow handlers",
      "source_hash": 13827501428475531552,
      "context_hash": 12036022197679147331,
      "translation": "Flow 핸들러",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:29:48.483515Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The flow handler (`handle_irq` in `irq_desc`) determines how interrupt delivery works:",
      "source_hash": 6082850586105407249,
      "context_hash": 5432541033445996037,
      "translation": "flow 핸들러(`irq_desc`의 `handle_irq`)는 인터럽트 전달이 어떻게 이루어지는지를 결정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:29:48.483515Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Handler",
      "source_hash": 9049366408480183470,
      "context_hash": 13638224120464065796,
      "translation": "핸들러",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 11106116085815784902,
      "translation": "용도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_edge_irq`",
      "source_hash": 17704666208104246960,
      "context_hash": 4769411381656791103,
      "translation": "`handle_edge_irq`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Edge-triggered: ack before calling action chain",
      "source_hash": 7594071247549718682,
      "context_hash": 1549483955991330206,
      "translation": "Edge-triggered: action 체인을 호출하기 전에 ack",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_level_irq`",
      "source_hash": 11097059098629673582,
      "context_hash": 10068405048104170804,
      "translation": "`handle_level_irq`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Level-triggered: mask, run actions, unmask",
      "source_hash": 2768232925193328877,
      "context_hash": 14756932128632121376,
      "translation": "Level-triggered: mask, action 실행, unmask",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_fasteoi_irq`",
      "source_hash": 13632867635334729835,
      "context_hash": 10083864869616226386,
      "translation": "`handle_fasteoi_irq`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Modern level (with EOI): most ARM/x86 MSI",
      "source_hash": 3802945892667420018,
      "context_hash": 7227101827767373725,
      "translation": "최신 level 방식(EOI 사용): 대부분의 ARM/x86 MSI",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MSI": "MSI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:33:31.212903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_percpu_irq`",
      "source_hash": 12494450895435725076,
      "context_hash": 2223065967178113111,
      "translation": "`handle_percpu_irq`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675666Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Per-CPU interrupts (local timer, IPI)",
      "source_hash": 10438762216668505411,
      "context_hash": 12280506928074701791,
      "translation": "CPU별 인터럽트(로컬 타이머, IPI)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IPI": "IPI",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675667Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`handle_simple_irq`",
      "source_hash": 371917361906408665,
      "context_hash": 4908802952864855374,
      "translation": "`handle_simple_irq`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "No mask/ack, just run actions",
      "source_hash": 3076292912660889948,
      "context_hash": 17835346269573306885,
      "translation": "mask/ack 없이 action만 실행",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "The difference between edge and level matters:",
      "source_hash": 13951589583663244271,
      "context_hash": 11689166675585335371,
      "translation": "edge 방식과 level 방식의 차이는 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675668Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "**Edge**: interrupt fires once when signal transitions.",
      "source_hash": 6058363674720585463,
      "context_hash": 13541009169679635697,
      "translation": "**Edge**: 신호가 전이될 때 인터럽트가 한 번 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:15/seg:1",
      "source": "If missed, it won't fire again.",
      "source_hash": 3261877148311097140,
      "context_hash": 6854888067761846882,
      "translation": "이를 놓치면 다시 발생하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675669Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "**Level**: interrupt fires as long as signal is asserted.",
      "source_hash": 2047904405443195757,
      "context_hash": 4492790667401515886,
      "translation": "**Level**: 신호가 assert되어 있는 동안 인터럽트가 계속 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "Must be masked during handling.",
      "source_hash": 13228843090198825187,
      "context_hash": 14832606969083480953,
      "translation": "처리하는 동안에는 마스킹해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675670Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing IRQ state",
      "source_hash": 18384200589563338840,
      "context_hash": 6195352251825056453,
      "translation": "IRQ 상태 관찰",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:16.675670Z",
      "issues": []
